{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595324-who-is-who-in-the-literal-apocalypse","id":595324,"title":"Who is Who in The Literal Apocalypse","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-18T20:35:47-07:00","id":595324,"title":"Who is Who in The Literal Apocalypse","content":"I been thinking on the book of revelations, The two witnesses, The harlot, The seven headed dragon etc... And i been thinking. Who do you think, would be a good representation of all The mentioned figures of The Biblical Apocalypse in the WoD. Which NPCs would fit in which roles?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T21:10:49-07:00","id":595343,"title":"","content":"Seven headed dragon? Maybe that is Legion, from Player's guide? The Harlot riding it could be a female Earth-Bound that was absorbed by it and absorbed successfully absorbed Legion in turn. <br /> <br /> Alternatively, the Book of Houses have shown that many Fallen are dividing along House lines now that they are starting to find their feet. Maybe the Seven are essentially the heads of the seven Houses and they manage to rally together their housemate for some great undertaking. The harlot could Lucifer, but that doesn't feel right. Perhaps it's a Mage who possesses some sort of knowledge that gives her leverage over them? How to achieve redemption, how to regain their lost powers, how to do something about/to/for the Earthbound, how to become a perfected version of the Nephilhiem, and so on. The Harlot should be either a Technocrat or a Celestial Choruser, however, because Harlot implies &quot;sellout.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T21:53:54-07:00","id":595383,"title":"","content":"I was thinking the Harlot would be Lilith","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T22:20:32-07:00","id":595393,"title":"","content":"Meh. She doesn't serve a useful purpose. Besides, why call her a whore?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T22:37:22-07:00","id":595399,"title":"","content":"She is the Mother of Night and Monsters, she has lain with Caine, Lucifer, and God only knows who else. She sells her body for the secrets of others or for the safety they might offer. Such has always been her way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-18T23:29:49-07:00","id":595409,"title":"","content":"Fair enough. I just don't like the judgemental aspects of sleeping around. Being a traitor seems much more appropriate for condemnation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T01:36:25-07:00","id":595486,"title":"","content":"That's Heaven for you, always judging everyone based on inscrutable divine standards of decency in a world gone to shit in a handbasket. As for treason, treason is relative.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T02:56:29-07:00","id":595508,"title":"","content":"Well, surely you could give twists to all of those figures. In Demon you can't say for sure who was behind the bible, after all.<br /> <br /> I would personaly throw other splats on this if its to be the end times coming, even if the chronicle was mainly about Demons.<br /> <br /> The most obvious dragon could be Tzimisce. With his transformation INTO Vicissitude he could be literaly seven-headed or even manifest on seven people at the same time. By the way, Tzimisce poses the interesting twist of being able to manifest in non-vampiric bodies, since everyone could theoreticaly &quot;contract&quot; Vicissitude. He could be at the same time a Vampire, a Fera, a Mage, a Changeling, a Hunter, a Mummy and a Demon. All with mastery over his trademark Discipline, his mind in control and all the powers each should have.<br /> <br /> Just to know, he could be able to bypass the mind immunity by controling the body directly, and bind the Demon to his will with his mastery also over Tzimisce Sorcery.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T11:15:29-07:00","id":595779,"title":"","content":"In order of appearance:<br /> <br /> John of Patmos<br /> The angel who reveals the Revelation of Jesus Christ<br /> The One who sits on the Throne<br /> Twenty-four crowned elders<br /> Four living creatures<br /> The Lion of Judah who is the seven horned Lamb with seven eyes<br /> Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse<br /> Four angels holding the four winds of the Earth<br /> The seal-bearer angel<br /> Seven angelic trumpeters<br /> The star called Wormwood<br /> Angel of Woe<br /> Scorpion-tailed Locusts<br /> Abaddon<br /> Four angels bound to the great river Euphrates<br /> Two hundred million lion-headed cavalry<br /> The mighty angel of Seven thunders<br /> The Two witnesses<br /> Beast of the Sea having seven heads and ten horns<br /> The woman and her child<br /> The Dragon, fiery red with seven heads<br /> Michael the Archangel<br /> Lamb-horned Beast of the Earth<br /> Image of the Beast of the sea<br /> The False Prophet<br /> Whore of Babylon<br /> Death and Hades","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T15:33:19-07:00","id":597408,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tenkage</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595324-who-is-who-in-the-literal-apocalypse?p=595779#post595779\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In order of appearance:<br /> <br /> John of Patmos / Witness 1? Bookworm?<br /> The angel who reveals the Revelation of Jesus Christ / No Idea<br /> The One who sits on the Throne / Lucifer/Tzimisce?<br /> Twenty-four crowned elders / Erm..The primogens?<br /> Four living creatures / Could be anything<br /> The Lion of Judah who is the seven horned Lamb with seven eyes / No idea<br /> Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse / Zzyzzak, Belial, Vykos and Voormas?<br /> Four angels holding the four winds of the Earth / Four Main PC?<br /> The seal-bearer angel / The Umbra<br /> Seven angelic trumpeters / no idea<br /> The star called Wormwood / The comet or Red Star<br /> Angel of Woe / No idea whats Woe<br /> Scorpion-tailed Locusts / sounds like an earthbound or Seth<br /> Abaddon / Ha ha! Earthbound!<br /> Four angels bound to the great river Euphrates / Probably related to the Fall of Stygia<br /> Two hundred million lion-headed cavalry / Sounds about right related to the number of demons that Should exist<br /> The mighty angel of Seven thunders / Incarnas or perhaps some elder garous?<br /> The Two witnesses / could be anything, but mainly someone telling whats going on..Either Bookworm revealing the apocalypse in the radio or even Becket<br /> Beast of the Sea having seven heads and ten horns / O hai Belial!<br /> The woman and her child / Could be the chick from Gehenna, the one who is pregnant in the begining of the book?<br /> The Dragon, fiery red with seven heads / i call dibs, Wyrm<br /> Michael the Archangel / A mage perhaps?<br /> Lamb-horned Beast of the Earth / i Call dibs on the Perfect Metis or the horned garou from some of the books (the one that appears on the covers)<br /> Image of the Beast of the sea / O hai Belial!<br /> The False Prophet / O Hai Pentex<br /> Whore of Babylon / O Hai Technocracy-Null Thread<br /> Death and Hades / O Hai Nuklear bomb in the Umbra!</div> </div> </div> </div>Thats how i see it","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T23:55:30-07:00","id":598009,"title":"","content":"Really liked the choice for the Four Horsemen, Crowley. The relation between the Red Star and Wormwood is so obvious that it is used on one of the Gehenna scenarios. But is a good one, nonetheless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-22T14:40:38-07:00","id":599836,"title":"","content":"The Four animals are represented by the Eagle, Lion, Bull, and Man.<br /> The One who sits on the Throne is supposed to be the Throne of God, in which case you could argue for God, Michael, Lucifer, or the Messengers.<br /> The two witnesses are meant to be mortals but I was thinking the Dhampir chick and Ferox from Gehenna.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}